/-! Exact rational polynomial certificates locate the Gaussian normalization
parameter to the precision displayed in the manuscript. The residual-square
identities and factorial moments are checked by Lean arithmetic. No floating
point result or numerical integration is an assumption.

For the lower endpoint use n=16, and for the upper endpoint use n=24.
The arrays represent R(s)=L_n(s)/L_n(-1/t), D(s)=R(s)^2 and
C(s)=(1-D(s))/(1+t*s), where L_n(s)=sum_k (-1)^k choose(n,k)s^k/k!.
No Laguerre identity or orthogonality result is assumed. The displayed
polynomial identities and all exponential moments are checked directly. -/
